{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-gen-13-1","title":"Genesis 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Abram and Lot return with great riches out of Egypt. 6 Strife arises between Abram's herdsmen and those of Lot. 8 Abram meekly refers it to Lot to choose his part of the country, 10 and Lot goes to Sodom. 14 God renews the promise to Abram. 18 He removes to Hebron, and there builds an altar.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2086. B.C. 1918. the south.The south of Canaan; as in leaving Egypt, it is said he \"came from the south,\" (ver. 3,) and the southern part of the promised land lay north-east of Egypt.</p>\n<p>12:9-20; 20:1; 21:33; Jos 10:40; 18:5; 1Sa 27:10; 2Sa 24:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-2","title":"Genesis 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>24:35; 26:12,13; De 8:18; 1Sa 2:7; Job 1:3,10; 22:21-25; Ps 112:1-3 Pr 3:9,10; 10:22; Mt 6:33; 1Ti 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-3","title":"Genesis 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>from. 12:6,8,9 Beth-el and Hai.i.e., The place which was afterwards called Bethel by Jacob, and so called when Moses wrote; for its first name was Luz. (ch. 28:19.)</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-4","title":"Genesis 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Unto. 18; 12:7,8; 35:1-3; Ps 26:8; 42:1,2; 84:1,2,10 called. 4:26; Ps 65:1,2; 107:1,8,15; 116:2,17; 145:18; Isa 58:9; Jer 29:12 Zep 3:9; 1Co 1:2; Eph 6:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-5","title":"Genesis 13:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>tents. 4:20; 25:27; Jer 49:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-6","title":"Genesis 13:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>36:6,7; Ec 5:10,11; Lu 12:17,18; 1Ti 6:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-7","title":"Genesis 13:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>a strife. 21:25; 26:20; Ex 2:17; 1Co 3:3; Ga 5:20; Tit 3:3; Jas 3:16; 4:1 Canaanite. 10:19; 12:6; 15:18-21; 34:30; Ne 5:9; Php 2:14,15; Col 4:5 1Th 4:12; 1Pe 2:12 dwelled.i.e., They were there when Abram and Lot came to pitch their tents in the land.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-8","title":"Genesis 13:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Let. Pr 15:1; Mt 5:9; 1Co 6:6,7; Php 2:14; Heb 12:14; Jas 3:17,18 brethren. Heb. men, brethren. 11:27-31; 45:24; Ex 2:13; Ps 133:1; Ac 7:26; Ro 12:10; Eph 4:2,3 1Th 4:9; Heb 13:1; 1Pe 1:22; 2:17; 3:8; 4:8; 2Pe 1:7; 1Jo 2:9-11 1Jo 3:14-19; 4:7,20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-9","title":"Genesis 13:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Is not. 20:15; 34:10 if thou wilt. Ps 120:7; Ro 12:18; 1Co 6:7; Heb 12:14; Jas 3:13-18; 1Pe 3:8-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-10","title":"Genesis 13:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>and beheld. 3:6; 6:2; Nu 32:1-42; 1Jo 2:15,16 the plain. 19:17,24,25; De 34:3; 1Ki 7:46; Ps 107:34; 1Jo 2:15 the garden. 2:9,10; Isa 51:3; Eze 28:13; 31:8; Joe 2:3 Zoar. 14:2,8; 19:20,22-30; De 34:3; Isa 15:5; Jer 48:34 Instead of \"Zoar,\" which was situated at the extremity of the plain of Jordan, the Syriac reads \"Zoan,\" which was situated in the south of Egypt, and in a well-watered country.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-11","title":"Genesis 13:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>A.M. 2087. B.C. 1917. chose. 19:17 they. 9,14; Ps 16:3; 119:63; Pr 27:10; Heb 10:25; 1Pe 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-12","title":"Genesis 13:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Lot dwelled. 19:29 pitched. 14:12; 19:1; Ps 26:5; 1Co 15:33; 2Pe 2:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-13","title":"Genesis 13:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>But the. 15:16; 18:20; 19:4-11; 1Sa 15:18; Isa 1:9; 3:9; Eze 16:46-50 Mt 9:10,13; 11:23,24; Joh 9:24,31; Ro 1:27; 2Pe 2:6-8,10; Jude 1:7 before. 6:11; 10:9; 38:7; 2Ki 21:6; Isa 3:8; Jer 23:24; Heb 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-14","title":"Genesis 13:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>was. 11 Lift. 10; Isa 49:18; 60:4 northward. 28:14; De 3:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-15","title":"Genesis 13:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>12:7; 15:18; 17:7,8; 18:18; 24:7; 26:3,4; 28:4,13; 35:12; 48:4; Ex 33:1 Nu 34:2,12-29; De 26:2-4; 34:4; 2Ch 20:7; Ne 9:7,8; Ps 37:22,29 Ps 105:9-12; 112:1,2; Isa 63:18; Mt 5:5; Ac 7:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-16","title":"Genesis 13:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>12:2,3; 15:5; 17:6,16,20; 18:18; 21:13; 22:17; 25:1-34; 26:4; 28:3,14 32:12; 35:11; 36:1-43; 46:3; Ex 1:7; 32:13; Nu 23:10; De 1:10 Jud 6:3,5; 1Ki 3:8; 4:20; 1Ch 21:5; 27:23; 2Ch 17:14-18; Isa 48:18 Isa 48:19; Jer 33:22; Ro 4:16-18; Heb 11:12; Re 7:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-13-18","title":"Genesis 13:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>plain. Heb. plains. Mamre. 14:13; 18:1 Hebron. 23:2; 35:27; 37:14; Nu 13:22; Jos 14:13 altar. 4; 8:20; 12:7,8; Ps 16:8; 1Ti 2:8</p>"}]}